This repository is a JAX port of the AMAGOLD reference implementation,
    https://github.com/ruqizhang/amagold
by Ruqi Zhang, A. Feder Cooper and Christopher De Sa, which accompanies

    Zhang, Cooper and De Sa. "AMAGOLD: Amortized Metropolis Adjustment for
    Efficient Stochastic Gradient MCMC." AISTATS 2020, PMLR 108:2142-2152.

The method, the experimental design and the original code are theirs; this
repository ports them and does not introduce them. The upstream commits
survive in this repository's git history. The original repository carries no
license of its own; this port is released under the Apache License 2.0 with
the knowledge and agreement of its authors (Ruqi Zhang, October 2026).

The port was written with the assistance of Claude Code (Anthropic).
If you use this software, please cite the paper above (see CITATION.cff).
